# Build and OS junk
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# Bulk StatCan downloads. Every one of these is a public file that the
# pipeline either re-fetches on its own or that pipeline/README.md names
# precisely enough to download by hand; see "Getting the inputs" there.
# They are excluded because each exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit,
# 4.8 GB in total.
#
# Census Profile data tables (3.6 GB, 809 MB, 367 MB). The small
# *_meta.txt and *_Geo_starting_row*.CSV siblings stay tracked, so the
# products remain identifiable without the bulk.
*_English_CSV_data*.csv

# Boundary files downloaded by `make boundaries` (pipeline/03_fetch_boundaries.py).
pipeline/data/*.zip

# Regional district boundaries downloaded by `make districts`
# (pipeline/03b_fetch_districts.py). 19.8 MB of DataBC geometry that the
# pipeline uses once, to prove the census-division -> regional-district
# crosswalk; the result travels in out/service_areas.json instead.
pipeline/data/regional_districts.geojson

# Municipal boundaries downloaded by `make municipalities`
# (pipeline/03d_fetch_municipalities.py). Used once, by
# 05b_exclude_nested_municipalities.py, to test containment; the result
# travels in out/geoname_shortlist.csv and out/excluded_within_municipality.csv
# instead.
pipeline/data/municipalities.geojson
